# oracle: pair_style adp on Ni.adp (Mishin et al. 2005, single element), fcc 3x3x3 cells (108 atoms) at a = 3.52 A with 0.05 A random displacements, velocities create 800 K, fix nve, 100 steps of 0.002 ps; thermo every 20 steps
# oracle-potentials: Ni.adp
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-9 abs=1e-12
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (thermo rows, final atoms): thermo 1.6e-13, atoms 1.4e-13.
units           metal
atom_style      atomic
lattice         fcc 3.52
region          box block 0 3 0 3 0 3
create_box      1 box
create_atoms    1 box
mass            1 58.6934
displace_atoms  all random 0.05 0.05 0.05 4711 units box
pair_style      adp
pair_coeff      * * Ni.adp Ni
timestep        0.002
fix             1 all nve
thermo_style    custom step pe ke press pxx pyy pzz pxy pxz pyz
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          20
velocity        all create 800 4928459 rot yes dist gaussian loop geom
run             100
